# Docs, ADR, Attribution

## When to write an ADR
Add `docs/adr/ADR-XXXX.md` when introducing:
- new MCP server/provider
- new vector store / embeddings model
- new caching backend
- major workflow change (graph nodes, evidence schema)

## Attribution (mandatory)
- Final answers must include a “Sources” section with URLs/IDs/titles.
- Do not include large verbatim text. Prefer summaries + short excerpts.
- Keep a dedicated `docs/attribution.md` describing how we attribute each source.
